1
00:00:00,195 --> 00:00:01,485
(Leslie:)Wow.

2
00:00:02,447 --> 00:00:05,447
(Leslie:)So I heard your relationship with Penny
crashed to the ground...

3
00:00:05,617 --> 00:00:08,457
(Leslie:)...like blue ice
falling out of an airplane lavatory.

4
00:00:09,454 --> 00:00:13,874
- Where'd you hear that?
- Actually, I read it. Wolowitz texted me.

5
00:00:14,459 --> 00:00:18,129
"Like blue ice
falling out of an airplane lavatory," yep.

6
00:00:18,296 --> 00:00:21,886
Yeah, I thought it was a pretty good one.
I gave him an "LOL."

7
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,510
(Leslie:)Anyway, it got me thinking.

8
00:00:23,676 --> 00:00:27,636
(Leslie:)Now that you're unattached, maybe
we can revisit our previous attachment.

9
00:00:27,806 --> 00:00:31,226
(Leonard:)Are you suggesting another bout
of stress release?

10
00:00:31,393 --> 00:00:32,933
(Leslie:)No, I'm all done with casual sex.

11
00:00:33,103 --> 00:00:35,983
(Leslie:)I'm fully committed
to the traditional relationship paradigm.

12
00:00:36,147 --> 00:00:37,147
Really? What changed?

13
00:00:37,649 --> 00:00:39,649
(Leslie:)There's just a time
in every woman's life...

14
00:00:39,818 --> 00:00:42,108
(Leslie:)...when she gets tired of waking up
on a futon...

15
00:00:42,278 --> 00:00:44,528
(Leslie:)...with a bunch of people
she doesn't know.

16
00:00:45,323 --> 00:00:48,823
(Leonard:)Yeah, I can see how that would...
A bunch of people?

17
00:00:48,993 --> 00:00:51,493
(Leslie:)Anyway, I just figure
it's time to slow things down...

